<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" ><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/curated-corner/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml" /><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" /><updated>2026-09-12T09:54:23+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/curated-corner/feed.xml</id><title type="html">Tevin Zhang | Curated_corner</title><subtitle>A slice of Tevin&apos;s mind.</subtitle><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><entry xml:lang="en"><title type="html">v86</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/en/curated-corner/v86/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="v86" /><published>2026-09-09T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-09-10T13:59:10+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/en/curated-corner/v86</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><category term="Digital" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[v86 is a collection of operating systems that you can run inside your browser by emulating an x86 platform, there are Linux, BSD, Windows, DOS, Unix-like systems, and others that don’t belong to any.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="en"><title type="html">Infinite Mac</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/en/curated-corner/infinite-mac/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Infinite Mac" /><published>2026-09-09T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-09-10T13:59:10+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/en/curated-corner/infinite-mac</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><category term="Digital" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Infinite Mac is a collection of classic Macintosh and NeXT systems and software that you can run right in your browser. It’s easier than setting each of them up yourself, if you just want to try out different versions or take a quick look around.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="en"><title type="html">Drawing and painting lessons</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/en/curated-corner/drawing-lessons/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Drawing and painting lessons" /><published>2026-09-09T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-09-10T13:59:10+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/en/curated-corner/drawing-lessons</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><category term="Visual" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[I’m no profession in drawing and have zero intent of becoming one. Honestly, I suck at drawing, but I still find joy in it, especially when I end up better than I thought, so I’ve been teaching myself from time to time.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="zh"><title type="html">v86</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/zh/curated-corner/v86/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="v86" /><published>2026-09-09T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-09-10T13:59:10+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/zh/curated-corner/v86</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><category term="数字" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[v86 收集了一系列操作系统，你可以通过模拟 x86 平台在浏览器里运行它们——有 Linux、BSD、Windows、DOS、类 Unix 系统，以及一些不属于上述类别的系统。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="zh"><title type="html">Infinite Mac</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/zh/curated-corner/infinite-mac/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Infinite Mac" /><published>2026-09-09T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-09-10T13:59:10+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/zh/curated-corner/infinite-mac</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><category term="数字" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Infinite Mac 收集了一批经典的 Macintosh 和 NeXT 系统以及软件，你可以直接在浏览器里运行它们。如果你只是想试试不同的版本、或简单四处看看，它比你自己逐一套装要省事得多。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="zh"><title type="html">绘画与素描练习</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/zh/curated-corner/drawing-lessons/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="绘画与素描练习" /><published>2026-09-09T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-09-10T13:59:10+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/zh/curated-corner/drawing-lessons</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><category term="看" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[我不是绘画方面的专家，也没打算走专业路线。说实话，我画得挺烂的，但我还是从中找到乐趣，尤其当我画得比自己以为的好时会更有成就感,所以我也时不时自学一下。]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="en"><title type="html">Tips for being online</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/en/curated-corner/tips-for-being-online/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Tips for being online" /><published>2025-02-28T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-09-10T13:59:10+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/en/curated-corner/tips-for-being-online</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><category term="Digital" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Privacy is not secret, one has nothing to hide doesn’t mean one has nothing to protect. Here are some tips to help you protect your privacy online:]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="zh"><title type="html">网上冲浪小贴士</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/zh/curated-corner/tips-for-being-online/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="网上冲浪小贴士" /><published>2025-02-28T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-09-10T13:59:10+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/zh/curated-corner/tips-for-being-online</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(dot)com</email></author><category term="数字" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[隐私不等于秘密，没什么可隐瞒不意味着没什么需要保护。 以下是一些帮助你保护在线隐私的建议：]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://tevinzhang.com/assets/avatar.png" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry xml:lang="en"><title type="html">Best sound from a kazoo I’ve ever heard</title><link href="https://tevinzhang.com/en/curated-corner/best-kazoo/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Best sound from a kazoo I’ve ever heard" /><published>2025-02-25T00:00:00+08:00</published><updated>2026-09-10T13:59:10+08:00</updated><id>https://tevinzhang.com/en/curated-corner/best-kazoo</id><author><name>Tevin Zhang</name><email>hey(at)tevinzhang(